+- `/repos/{repo}/readme/{ref}`
+- `/repos/{repo}/merge-requests/*`
+- `/repos/{repo}/issues/*`
+- `/repos/{repo}/settings`
+- `/markdown/render`
+- `/actions/preview`, `/actions/execute`
+- `/ws`
+
+All mutating routes must support idempotency keys and audit records.
