@@ -0,0 +1,74 @@
+# JeRyu WebSocket Protocol
+
+Endpoint: `/api/web/v1/ws`.
+
+Client frames:
+
+```json
+{ "type": "hello", "client_id": "browser", "last_seen_event_id": 123 }
+{ "type": "subscribe", "topics": ["global", "repo:owner/name"] }
+{ "type": "unsubscribe", "topics": ["repo:owner/name"] }
+{ "type": "ping", "nonce": "abc" }
+```
+
+Server frames:
+
+```json
+{
+  "type": "event",
+  "event_id": 124,
+  "topic": "repo:owner/name",
+  "occurred_at": "2026-05-26T00:00:00Z",
+  "kind": "repo.updated",
+  "subject": { "type": "repository", "id": "repo_1" },
+  "payload": {}
+}
+```
+
+Rules:
+
+- authorize every topic subscription;
+- replay by `last_seen_event_id` where durable events exist;
+- send `snapshot_required` when replay is unavailable;
+- compact high-volume log events for slow clients;
+- never block writes on websocket fanout.
