+# JeRyu Web Settings Matrix
+
+Settings scopes:
+
+- user
+- organization/workspace
+- repository
+- instance/system
+
+Repository settings categories:
+
+- general: name, description, topics, visibility, default branch, archive/delete/transfer;
+- features: issues, wiki, releases, packages, CI, agents, VTI, cache;
+- access: collaborators, teams, deploy keys, protected environments, token scopes;
+- branch protection: patterns, required MR, approvals, CODEOWNERS, status checks, signed commits, linear history, bypasses;
+- merge requests: merge method, squash, auto-delete source branch, stale approval invalidation, thread resolution, exact-SHA approval;
+- CI/CD: templates, variables metadata, runner pools, timeouts, artifacts, cache keys, schedules;
+- agents/autonomy: allowed agents, autonomy level, tools, model limits, sandbox, secrets access;
+- webhooks/integrations: outbound hooks, filters, delivery logs, retries, mirror targets;
+- audit/compliance: retention, immutable mode, export, evidence requirements.
